        "calls": 1,
        "title": "Set 312.5k context pruner budget for DeepSeek V4.1 Flash",
        "summary": "The context pruner budget for DeepSeek V4.1 Flash and its fast mode is lowered to 312.5k tokens, changing the effective compaction threshold from the default 320k to 250k. This change addresses cost impact from re-reading cached input for large sessions, where 35% of Flash calls exceeded 180k tokens, ensuring the model compacts earlier to minimize re-read costs. The new budget is defined as `DEEPSEEK_FLASH_CONTEXT_BUDGET` in `common/src/constants/model-config.ts` and is enforced by `contextPrunerBudgetForModel`.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "operators",
        "evidence": "In `common/src/constants/model-config.ts`, `contextPrunerBudgetForModel` is updated to check a new `DEEPSEEK_FLASH_MODELS` set and return the new constant `DEEPSEEK_FLASH_CONTEXT_BUDGET` (312_500).",
        "userVisible": false,
        "confidence": "medium",
