        "title": "Add scheme normalization for bare MCP server URLs",
        "summary": "Adds normalizeMcpServerUrl to supply a missing https:// or http:// scheme to MCP server addresses that users paste without one, such as example.com/mcp or localhost:3000/mcp. In common/src/mcp/client.ts, remoteMcpUrl now routes through the normalizer so getMCPClient accepts bare hosts for both http and sse remote transports. In common/src/desktop-cloud/custom-mcp.ts, the url field of customMcpInputSchema overwrites its string transform with the normalizer and adds a front-line loopback-host refinement that shows a friendly error when a Cloud custom MCP points at localhost or a 127.x address.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "New file common/src/mcp/server-url.ts defines normalizeMcpServerUrl to prefix missing https/http schemes; common/src/desktop-cloud/custom-mcp.ts and common/src/mcp/client.ts now call it before URL validation and transport construction.",
